# Copy to .env.local and fill in your own Supabase project's values
# (Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard). The anon key is safe to
# keep here in spirit -- it is constrained entirely by the RLS policies
# in supabase/schema.sql -- but .env.local itself is still gitignored.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
